      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "widgets_values": [
        "## De-rope -> PixelForge (blubs v1)\n\nLoadVideo -> fit -> jerk oracle -> time smear -> v2v re-denoise (inject 0.70) -> exact recover -> Sprite Studio (Gentle key, 8 colors) -> GIF/sheet.\n\n1. Pick your clip in **Load Video** (a green-screen sprite gen).\n2. Aspect in **Resolution Selector** must match the footage (bunny = 16:9 @ 0.5MP).\n3. Describe the clip in the **MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo** prompt - the sharpness clause does the de-roping.\n4. Queue. Sprite lands in output/pixelforge/derope_sprite_*.\n\nSpeed stack matches n.json: ck attention + chunk feed-forward. KJNodes required (already installed)."
      ]
    }
